# AI PODS ENTERPRISE SAAS — CLAUDE AGENT RULES

MANDATORY INSTRUCTIONS FOR CLAUDE CODE & AGENTIC TOOLS:

1. ALWAYS read .aipods/skills/ before proposing any change.
2. ALWAYS verify that a GitHub Issue exists with mandatory labels (e.g. gh issue create --label "feature,needs-spec").
3. ALWAYS follow Spec-Driven Development (SDD): no code without a spec in specs/active/ or consolidated in specs/0X_*_MASTER_SPEC.md.
